"<h3>ReDi Restaurant Reservation Plugin</h3> <p>Plugin er aktiv, men API-"
"nøglen er endnu ikke genereret til at bruge plugin'et. Finiliser "
"opsætningsguiden nu til problemfri bookinger.</p> %s"

#. %s is the HTML link to the setup wizard.
#: functions/notice.php:75
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<h3>ReDi Restaurant Reservation Plugin</h3> <p>Plugin is active but you have "
"not created a page with reservation form. Finilize setup wizard now for "
"seamless bookings.</p> %s"
msgstr ""
"<h3>ReDi Restaurant Reservation Plugin</h3> <p>Plugin er aktiv, men du har "
"ikke oprettet en side med reservationsformular. Finiliser opsætningsguiden "
"nu til problemfri bookinger.</p> %s"

#. %s is the HTML link to the configuration page.
#: functions/notice.php:98
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<p>You have not made any changes to settings since you have installed the "
"plugin. Finilize <b>ReDi Restaurant Reservation Plugin</b> setup now for "
"seamless bookings. Visit the %1$s to finilize configuration and start "
"impress your clients!</p> %2$s"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du har ikke foretaget nogen ændringer i indstillingerne, siden du har "
"installeret plugin'et. Finilize <b>ReDi Restaurant Reservation Plugin</b> "
"opsætning nu for problemfri bookinger. Besøg %1$s for at finjustere "
"konfigurationen og begynde at imponere dine kunder!</p> %2$s"

#: templates/admin.php:122
msgid ""
"<strong>Attention</strong>: New settings are available for review and saving,"
" please take a moment to update your preferences or fill out the required "
"settings and click on the save button."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bemærk</strong>: Nye indstillinger er tilgængelige til gennemsyn og "
"lagring, brug venligst et øjeblik på at opdatere dine præferencer eller "
"udfyld de nødvendige indstillinger og klik på knappen Gem."

#: templates/frontend.php:338
msgid ""
"A confirmation email has been sent to you, should you not receive it, please "
"rest assured that your booking has been received and is confirmed. If you "
"wish you may contact us by phone to confirm."
msgstr ""
"En bekræftelses-e-mail er blevet sendt til dig, hvis du ikke modtager den, "
"kan du være sikker på, at din reservation er modtaget og bekræftet. Hvis du "
"ønsker det, kan du kontakte os telefonisk for at bekræfte."

#: redi-restaurant-reservation.php:2050
msgid ""
"A confirmation email has been sent to you. If you don't receive it, please "
"rest assured that your booking has been confirmed. You may contact the "
"restaurant directly if you need to make any changes to your reservation."
msgstr ""
"En bekræftelses-e-mail er blevet sendt til dig. Hvis du ikke modtager den, "
"kan du være sikker på, at din reservation er blevet bekræftet. Du kan "
"kontakte restauranten direkte, hvis du har brug for at foretage ændringer i "
"din reservation."

#: templates/frontend_v2.php:934
msgid ""
"A confirmation email has been sent to your provided email address. No "
"further action is required. If you don't receive it, rest assured your "
"reservation is confirmed. You can also contact us by phone if needed."
msgstr ""
"En bekræftelses-e-mail er blevet sendt til din angivne e-mailadresse. Der "
"kræves ingen yderligere handling. Hvis du ikke modtager den, kan du være "
"sikker på, at din reservation er bekræftet. Du kan også kontakte os "
"telefonisk, hvis det er nødvendigt."

#: redi-restaurant-reservation.php:2051
msgid ""
"A confirmation email will be sent to you once your reservation request has "
"been approved. You may contact the restaurant directly if you need to make "
"any changes to your reservation request."
msgstr ""
"En bekræftelses-e-mail vil blive sendt til dig, når din "
"reservationsanmodning er blevet godkendt. Du kan kontakte restauranten "
"direkte, hvis du har brug for at foretage ændringer i din "
"reservationsanmodning."

#: templates/admin.php:230
